stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Pending: incident acceptance commits
    Pending --> Pending: capture / encode / upload / transient retry
    Pending --> Saved: artifacts verified and full sampled window committed
    Pending --> Incomplete: usable artifacts with missing coverage or capture error
    Pending --> Failed: no usable artifacts or admission failure
    Incomplete --> Pending: explicit retry with retained material
    Failed --> Pending: explicit retry with retained material
    Saved --> Tombstone: manual deletion
    Incomplete --> Tombstone: manual deletion
    Failed --> Tombstone: manual deletion
    Tombstone --> Tombstone: retry interrupted object and spool cleanup
    note right of Saved
        Remove spool after SQL completion commit.
        Keep completed objects until manual deletion.
    end note
    note right of Incomplete
        Retain actual coverage and reason codes.
        Missing footage cannot be invented by retry.
    end note
    note right of Tombstone
        Audit record and cleanup progress remain.
        Deletion is separate from capture outcome.
    end note
